              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Given the following XML, extract the EEMInfo elements of type Workspace and for each Workspace, retrieve:\n    - id\n    - name\n    - type\n    - A list of dependencies of type Report, each containing:\n        - id\n        - type\n        - name\n\nReturn the extracted data as a JSON list with the each item with following structure:\n```\n{\n      \"id\": \"workspace_id\",\n      \"name\": \"workspace_name\",\n      \"type\": \"Workspace\",\n      \"dependencies\": [\n        {\n          \"id\": \"report_id\",\n          \"type\": \"Report\",\n          \"name\": \"report_name\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n```\n\nXML to be processed is below : \n {{$context.$nodes.GET_MANIFEST_FILE.$output.result}}"
            },
