                  "id": "1762523149534",
                  "inputs": [
                    {
                      "id": "1762523149536_1",
                      "name": "prompt",
                      "type": "string",
                      "value": "**Step 1: Read Input**\n- Parse {{$context.$nodes.WORKFLOWS_RULES_PROCESSORS.$currentItem.fileDetails.fileContent}} as xml and look for `Rules` element, the `Rules` element may have multiple Rule element\n- Use the json for field and object mapping: {{$context.$variables.fieldMapping}} \n\n**Step 2: Process Each Rule**\n- For every `Rule` node found within any `Rules` node:\n    - Extract and organize the following information:\n        - **Triggers**: Extract trigger details. Make sure not to duplicate and add unnecessary entries copy only what is available in xml Convert all field and object names using the provided mapping to make them redwood-system friendly.\n        Consider following trigger types\n            - `EditorLoaded`\n            - `FieldValueChanged`\n            - `Named`\n            - `ObjectValueChanged`\n            - `ButtonClicked`\n        - **Conditions**: \n            - Extract logicalExpressions and conditions definitions from <Conditions> & nested <Condition> node. \n            - include operators, values, source & type(if type is object change it to uiControl in targetObject). \n            - Apply mapping to all relevant properties/fields.\n        - **Actions**: Extract actions associated with the rule from `<Then>` & `<Else>`, Use following instruction to construct the object\n            - object: which can be retrieved from `<Object>`'s value if Object.type is object assign it as 'uiControl'\n            - field: can be be retrieved from `<Object>`'s value if Object.type is Object the value can directly assign to field if Object.type is Field value contains both object & field which can be separated by dot, we also need to make sure the fields are mapped in redwood.\n        - **Mappings**: Include the original-to-redwood field mapping relevant to this rule.\n        - **id**  which should be unique for all rules should be constructed using trigger name & rule name (should be in camel case and should skip special characters & space characters)\n        - **workspaceId**  Should be assigned from {{$context.$nodes.WORKFLOWS_RULES_PROCESSORS.$currentItem.id}}\n    - Construct each rule as a declarative, schema-compliant JSON object.\n    - Push each constructed JSON object into a variable called `result`.\n\n**Step 3: Output**\n- Output the `result` variable as a JSON array containing all found and transformed rules.\n\n**Notes:**\n- Do *not* generate any JavaScript, pseudo-code, or executable statements. Only output the declarative, descriptive structure.\n- This JSON is meant as a prototype for migration or further automated code generation-it is not the final application logic.\n- Ensure all outputted field names and values use the mapping for migration to the redwood system.\n- Output must be strictly valid JSON and support downstream automation or review.\n- The input needs to be read from input variables will not be passed as file\n- If the rules section is not available generate empty array as output"
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "1762523149536_2",
                      "name": "temperature",
                      "type": "number",
                      "value": ""
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "LLM",
                  "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"array\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"id\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"name\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"object\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"enum\": [\n            \"ServiceRequest\",\n            \"Contact\"\n          ]\n        },\n        \"triggers\": {\n          \"type\": \"array\",\n          \"items\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"object\",\n              \"properties\": {\n                \"type\": {\n                  \"type\": \"string\",\n                  \"enum\": [\n                    \"vbEnter\",\n                    \"fieldValueChange\",\n                    \"ObjectValueChanged\",\n                    \"ButtonClicked\",\n                    \"Named\"\n                  ]\n                },\n                \"name\": {\n                  \"type\": \"string\",\n                  \"descriptions\": \"name of the NamedTrigger on which the action will be triggered applicable only for Named trigger\"\n                },\n                \"objectName\": {\n                  \"type\": \"string\"\n                },\n                \"objectId\": {\n                  \"type\": \"string\"\n                },\n                \"fieldName\": {\n                  \"type\": \"string\"\n                }\n              },\n              \"required\": [\n                \"type\",\n                \"objectName\",\n                \"fieldName\"\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        \"conditions\": {\n          \"type\": \"object\",\n          \"properties\": {\n            \"logicalExpression\": {\n              \"type\": \"string\"\n            },\n            \"conditions\": {\n              \"type\": \"array\",\n              \"items\": [\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"object\",\n                  \"properties\": {\n                    \"source\": {\n                      \"type\": \"string\"\n                    },\n                    \"type\": {\n                      \"type\": \"string\",\n                      \"enum\": [\n                        \"field\",\n                        \"uiControl\"\n                      ]\n                    },\n                    \"property\": {\n                      \"type\": \"string\"\n                    },\n                    \"operator\": {\n                      \"type\": \"string\"\n                    },\n                    \"value\": {\n                      \"type\": \"string\"\n                    }\n                  },\n                  \"required\": [\n                    \"source\",\n                    \"property\",\n                    \"operator\",\n                    \"value\"\n                  ]\n                }\n              ]\n            }\n          },\n          \"required\": [\n            \"logicalExpression\",\n            \"conditions\"\n          ]\n        },\n        \"thenActions\": {\n          \"$ref\": \"#/definitions/actions\"\n        },\n        \"elseActions\": {\n          \"$ref\": \"#/definitions/actions\"\n        },\n        \"fieldMappings\": {\n          \"type\": \"object\"\n        },\n        \"workspaceId\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"required\": [\n        \"id\",\n        \"name\",\n        \"object\",\n        \"triggers\",\n        \"conditions\",\n        \"thenActions\",\n        \"elseActions\",\n        \"fieldMappings\",\n        \"workspaceId\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"definitions\": {\n    \"actions\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"object\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"description\": \"The object on which operation has to be perform\",\n            \"enum\": [\n              \"uiControl\",\n              \"ServiceRequest\",\n              \"Contact\"\n            ]\n          },\n          \"fieldName\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"description\": \"The objects field on which operation needs to be made\"\n          },\n          \"operation\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"enum\": [\n              \"setFieldValue\",\n              \"fireEvent\",\n              \"assign\",\n              \"required\",\n              \"readonly\",\n              \"hidden\"\n            ]\n          },\n          \"relativeOperation\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          \"value\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\n          \"object\",\n          \"fieldName\",\n          \"operation\",\n          \"value\"\n        ]\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}"
                }
