                },
                {
                  "metadata": {
                    "name": "Rules Code generator"
                  },
                  "outcomes": {
                    "success": "1762530564733"
                  },
                  "code": "RULES_CODE_GENERATOR",
                  "id": "1762530491568",
                  "inputs": [
                    {
                      "id": "1762530491569_1",
                      "name": "prompt",
                      "type": "string",
                      "value": "As an agent you need to extend given json to a format which can be converted to various actionChain which can be plugged in a redwood application\n# STEP 1: INPUTS\n- Read the Rules JSON string from  {{$context.$nodes.LOOP_OVER_ALL_WORKSPACES.$currentItem}} \n- Read the Field Mappings JSON object from {{$context.$variables.fieldMapping}}\n- Read the LOV lookup from {{$context.$variables.lookup}}, the object contains value mapping from `b2c` to `redwood` for all fields (redwood names postfixed by lookup_cd) which can have list of possible values \n\n---\n\n# STEP 2: GROUP RULES\n- Group each rule by `$context.$nodes.LOOP_OVER_WORKSPACES.$currentItem.triggers[index].type`\n\n---\n\n# STEP 3: TRIGGER ARRAY PROCESSING\nFor each group of triggers:\n- If a action includes multiple `setFieldValue` operations in same condition, **merge them into a single `setFieldsValue` operation** where possible.\n\n---\n\n# Step 4: GENERATE JS EXPRESSION/Actions, Conditions & Operations\n\nFor each resulting rule object:\n\n1. **Add a property** called `js_expression` to the JSON node.\n2. **Field Retrieval:**  \n   For every field/uiControl referenced in both `conditions.logicalExpression`, `conditions.conditions` or in actions,  \n   generate the first line of the `js_expression` as:\n   ```javascript\n   const [field1, field2, ...] = (await $modules.uiEventsFramework.getFieldsValue(['OBJECT_NAME.field1', 'OBJECT_NAME.field2', ...], uefContext)).response.fields.map((e) => e.value);\n   Skip the line if no fields are used.\n   Replace field1, field2, etc. with all required field variable names.\n   Replace 'OBJECT_NAME' with the object property from the rule object.\n   \n\n3. **If-Else Construction:**\n   - Generate a JavaScript `if statement` that combines the conditions.logicalExpression and conditions.conditions, skip if condition and nested conditions are empty\n   - if the field used in comparison is one of the field in {{$context.$variables.lookup}}, use the corresponding redwood value for comparison\n   ```javascript\n   if (LOGICAL_EXPRESSION && CONDITION_EXPRESSIONS) {\n   // thenAction operations\n   } else {\n   // elseAction operations (if present)\n   }\n\n4. **Actions Generations:**\n   Actions in thenActions and elseActions should be converted into the appropriate JavaScript statements operation\n      - setFieldValue should be written like `\"await $modules.uiEventsFramework.setFieldValue('OBJECT_NAME.FIELD_NAME', VALUE, uefContext);\"` where FIELD_NAME & VALUE needs to be replaced from json node\n      - setFieldsValue should be written like `\"await $modules.uiEventsFramework.setFieldsValue(setFieldValueRequestObject, uefContext)\"`, where setFieldValueRequestObject is an array of object (containing property, fieldName (prefixed by object name & dot), value) for all fields which needs to be set ex: [{\n           fieldName: 'ServiceRequest.Title',\n           value: 'ValueFor the field'\n        }]\n      - fireEvent should be written like `\"await Actions.fireEvent(context, { event: 'eventName', payload: {uefContext: uefContext, methods} })\"` where eventName needs to be replaced by Value from json node\n      - assign should be written like `\"await $modules.uiEventsFramework.setFieldValue('OBJECT_NAME.FIELD_NAME', VALUE, uefContext);\"`, where OBJECT_NAME.FIELD_NAME should be assigned from value & VALUE should be assigned using value fetched for the object\n      - required, readonly & hidden operations should be written like `\"await $modules.expressionUtils.setFieldExpression(operationType, 'OBJECT_NAME.FIELD_NAME', Value)\"` where operationType, OBJECT_NAME.FIELD_NAME & Value needs to be replaced from action object properties\n\n   if the field which is being set is one of the field in {{$context.$variables.lookup}}, use the corresponding  redwood for value\n   Also consider sub operation\n   Replace action objects with corresponding JS statements (e.g., setFieldValue/setFieldsValue).\n\n5. **Merge possible objects**\n   - Multiple fieldValueChange on a same `rule.object`. & fields should be combined in a single rule object\n   - Multiple vbEnter on same `rule.object` should be combined in single object\n   - Make sure the resultant object represent both object's including name, id, js_expression\n   - make sure not to change js logic\n\n** OUTPUT **\nReturn the updated rule objects in JSON format, with js_expression property included as described.\nEach rule (or merged group as applicable) should be represented as a separate object in the output array.s"
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "1762530491570_2",
                      "name": "temperature",
                      "type": "number",
                      "value": ""
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "LLM",
                  "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#\",\n  \"title\": \"Rules Grouped by Trigger Type\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"patternProperties\": {\n    \"^[A-Za-z0-9_-]+$\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"id\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"description\": \"Unique identifier for the rule or group, should not contain special characters and space characters\"\n          },\n          \"name\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"description\": \"Descriptive name for the rule or group.\"\n          },\n          \"object\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"description\": \"The main object on which the rule operates.\"\n          },\n          \"triggers\": {\n            \"type\": \"array\",\n            \"description\": \"List of triggers for this rule.\",\n            \"items\": {\n              \"type\": \"object\",\n              \"properties\": {\n                \"type\": {\n                  \"type\": \"string\",\n                  \"enum\": [\n                    \"vbEnter\",\n                    \"fieldValueChange\",\n                    \"ObjectValueChanged\",\n                    \"ButtonClicked\",\n                    \"Named\"\n                  ]\n                },\n                \"name\": {\n                  \"type\": \"string\",\n                  \"descriptions\": \"name of the on which the action will be triggered applicable only for Named trigger\"\n                },\n                \"objectName\": {\n                  \"type\": \"string\"\n                },\n                \"objectId\": {\n                  \"type\": \"string\"\n                },\n                \"fieldName\": {\n                  \"type\": \"string\"\n                }\n              },\n              \"required\": [\n                \"type\",\n                \"objectName\",\n                \"fieldName\"\n              ]\n            }\n          },\n          \"conditions\": {\n            \"type\": \"object\",\n            \"description\": \"Object describing conditional logic for the rule.\",\n            \"properties\": {\n              \"logicalExpression\": {\n                \"type\": \"string\"\n              },\n              \"conditions\": {\n                \"type\": \"array\",\n                \"items\": {\n                  \"type\": \"object\",\n                  \"properties\": {\n                    \"source\": {\n                      \"type\": \"string\"\n                    },\n                    \"property\": {\n                      \"type\": \"string\"\n                    },\n                    \"operator\": {\n                      \"type\": \"string\"\n                    },\n                    \"value\": {}\n                  },\n                  \"required\": [\n                    \"source\",\n                    \"property\",\n                    \"operator\",\n                    \"value\"\n                  ]\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            \"required\": [\n              \"logicalExpression\",\n              \"conditions\"\n            ]\n          },\n          \"thenActions\": {\n            \"type\": \"array\",\n            \"description\": \"Array of actions for the 'then' case.\",\n            \"items\": {\n              \"type\": \"object\",\n              \"properties\": {\n                \"object\": {\n                  \"type\": \"string\"\n                },\n                \"operation\": {\n                  \"type\": \"string\"\n                },\n                \"value\": {}\n              },\n              \"required\": [\n                \"object\",\n                \"operation\",\n                \"value\"\n              ]\n            }\n          },\n          \"elseActions\": {\n            \"type\": \"array\",\n            \"description\": \"Array of actions for the 'else' case (if present).\",\n            \"items\": {\n              \"type\": \"object\",\n              \"properties\": {\n                \"object\": {\n                  \"type\": \"string\"\n                },\n                \"operation\": {\n                  \"type\": \"string\"\n                },\n                \"value\": {}\n              },\n              \"required\": [\n                \"object\",\n                \"operation\",\n                \"value\"\n              ]\n            }\n          },\n          \"fieldMappings\": {\n            \"type\": \"object\",\n            \"description\": \"Mapping of field names (from metadata).\",\n            \"additionalProperties\": {\n              \"type\": \"string\"\n            }\n          },\n          \"workspaceId\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          \"js_expression\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"description\": \"The generated JavaScript expression block.\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\n          \"id\",\n          \"object\",\n          \"triggers\",\n          \"conditions\",\n          \"thenActions\",\n          \"fieldMappings\",\n          \"js_expression\"\n        ],\n        \"additionalProperties\": false\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"description\": \"Top-level object is a map where each key is a trigger type (e.g., 'vbEnter', 'fieldValueChange'), and the value is an array of rule objects for that type.\"\n}"
                },
                {
                  "metadata": {
                    "name": "Triggers to action chain",
                    "returnType": "array",
                    "sourceCode": "const allTriggers = Object.keys($context.$nodes.RULES_CODE_GENERATOR.$output);\nconst object_and_path_mapping = {\n    ServiceRequest: {\n        createPageActionChainPaths: 'extension1/sources/ui/oracle_cx_serviceUI/applications/service/flows/ec/flows/sr/pages/create-page-x-chains/',\n        detailPageActionChainPaths: 'extension1/sources/ui/oracle_cx_serviceUI/applications/service/flows/ec/flows/sr/pages/details-page-x-chains/',\n        flowActionChainPaths: 'extension1/sources/ui/oracle_cx_serviceUI/applications/service/flows/ec/flows/sr/chains/'\n    }\n}\nlet workspaceId = null;\nallTriggers.some(trigger => {\n  let triggers = $context.$nodes.RULES_CODE_GENERATOR.$output[trigger];\n  if (Array.isArray(triggers) && triggers.length > 0) {\n    workspaceId = triggers[0].workspaceId || null;\n    return true;\n  }\n  return false;\n});\n\nconst result = [];\nconst ACTION_CHAIN_TEMPLATE = `\ndefine([\n  'vb/action/actionChain',\n  'vb/action/actions',\n  'vb/action/actionUtils',\n], (\n  ActionChain,\n  Actions,\n  ActionUtils\n) => {\n  'use strict';\n\n  class {{ACTION_CHAIN_NAME}} extends ActionChain {\n\n    /**\n     * @param {Object} context\n     */\n    async run(context, { uefContext, methods }) {\n        const { $flow, $application, $base, $extension, $constants, $modules } = context;\n\n        {{JS_EXPRESSION}}\n    }\n  }\n\n  return {{ACTION_CHAIN_NAME}};\n});\n`\n\n//**We will now create this action chain postfixed by workspace id */\nlet uiControlActionChainTemplate = `\ndefine([\n  'vb/action/actionChain',\n  'vb/action/actions',\n  'vb/action/actionUtils',\n], (\n  ActionChain,\n  Actions,\n  ActionUtils\n) => {\n  'use strict';\n\n  class UiControlActionChain_${workspaceId} extends ActionChain {\n\n    /**\n     * @param {Object} context\n     * @param {Object} params\n     * @param {object} params.controlInfo Ui Control Info\n     */\n    async run(context, { controlInfo, uefContext, methods }) {\n      const { $flow, $application, $base, $extension, $constants, $variables, $modules } = context;\n      const {\n        defaultValue,\n        labelHint,\n        'x-label': xLabel,\n        'x-type': xType,\n        'x-Id': xId\n      } = controlInfo;\n\n      switch (xId) {\n      {{UI_ACTIONS}}\n      default:\n        break;\n      }\n      \n    }\n  }\n\n  return UiControlActionChain_${workspaceId};\n});\n`;\n\n// There will be flow level fieldValueCHangeListeners according to workspace id\nlet RECORD_LEVEL_LISTENER_ACTION_CHAIN_TEMPLATE = `\ndefine([\n  'vb/action/actionChain',\n  'vb/action/actions',\n  'vb/action/actionUtils',\n], (\n  ActionChain,\n  Actions,\n  ActionUtils\n) => {\n  'use strict';\n  \n  class recordLevelEventListener_${workspaceId} extends ActionChain {\n\n    /**\n     * This event listener triggers on fieldValueChange, onBeforeSave and OnAfterSave events.\n     * @param {Object} context\n     * @param {Object} params\n     * @param {{data:any,eventName:string,recordType:string}} params.recordLevelEvent \n     */\n    async run(context, { recordLevelEvent, uefContext }) {\n      const { $page, $flow, $application, $base, $extension, $constants, $variables } = context;\n    \n      switch (recordLevelEvent.eventName) {\n\n        /** \n         * This case block (FieldValueChange) takes care of the field value change action chains \n         * Both migrated and customer created.\n         */\n        case 'FieldValueChange': { \n          /** \n           * flow:handleMigratedFieldValueChangeChainsAC\n           * This action chain takes care of the migrated field trigger chains.\n           * These chains are added to the object flow.\n           * */\n\n          {{FIELD_VALUE_ACTION_CHAIN_CALL}}\n          break;\n        }\n        case 'OnBeforeSave':\n          break;\n        case 'OnAfterSave':\n          break;\n        default:\n          break;\n      }\n    }\n  }\n\n  return recordLevelEventListener_${workspaceId};\n});\n`\n\nconst vb_enter_action_chain_template = `\n\ndefine([\n  'vb/action/actionChain',\n  'vb/action/actions',\n  'vb/action/actionUtils',\n], (\n  ActionChain,\n  Actions,\n  ActionUtils\n) => {\n  'use strict';\n\n  class registerRecordLevelEvents_vbEnter extends ActionChain {\n\n    /**\n     * @param {Object} context\n     */\n    async run(context) {\n      const { $page, $flow, $application, $base, $extension, $constants, $variables, $modules } = context;\n      const methods = $variables.methods;\n      const uefContext = $base.variables.uefContext;\n      const callRegisterEventsForRecordLevelEvent = $modules.uiEventsFramework.registerEventsForRecordLevelEvent(['OnBeforeSave', 'OnAfterSave', 'OnAfterCreate'], $base.variables.uefContext);\n\n\n      {{VB_ENTER_JS}}\n      }\n  }\n\n  return registerRecordLevelEvents_vbEnter;\n});\n\n`\n\n\nlet objectWiseVbEnter = {};\nlet uiControlObjectIdWiseCases = {};\nfor (let trigger of allTriggers) {\n    const actions = $context.$nodes.RULES_CODE_GENERATOR.$output[trigger];\n\n    for (let action of actions) {\n        const actionChainName = trigger === 'Named' ? action.id + 'Listener' :  action.id;\n        let content = ACTION_CHAIN_TEMPLATE\n            .replaceAll('{{ACTION_CHAIN_NAME}}', actionChainName)\n            .replace('{{JS_EXPRESSION}}', action.js_expression);\n\n\n        switch (trigger) {\n          case 'vbEnter':\n            objectWiseVbEnter['ServiceRequest'] = (objectWiseVbEnter['ServiceRequest'] || '') + `\n            /**\n             * ActionId: ${action.id}\n             **/\n             ${action.js_expression}\n\n            `\n          break;\n          case 'fieldValueChange':\n\n            /**\n             * Field Value action chains need to create an entry in createPage recordEvent listener\n             * */\n            result.push({\n                fileName: `${actionChainName}.js`,\n                description: `${object_and_path_mapping.ServiceRequest.flowActionChainPaths}${actionChainName}.js`,\n                fileContent: content\n            });\n\n\n          break;\n          case 'Named':\n\n            /**Named event action chain */\n            result.push({\n                fileName: `${actionChainName}Listener.js`,\n                description: `${object_and_path_mapping['ServiceRequest'].flowActionChainPaths}${actionChainName}.js`,\n                fileContent: content\n            });\n          break;\n          case 'ObjectValueChanged':\n          case 'ButtonClicked':\n            // We don't need to Action chains for these will put it directly in UIactionChain\n\n            (uiControlObjectIdWiseCases[`${action.triggers[0].objectId}`]  = uiControlObjectIdWiseCases[`${action.triggers[0].objectId}`] || []).push(`\n                ${action.js_expression}\n                `);\n\n          break;\n          \n        }\n    }\n}\n\n/**\n * Process vbEnterAction chains\n */\nObject.keys(objectWiseVbEnter).map((key) => {\n    result.push({\n        fileName: `registerRecordLevelEvents_vbEnter.js`,\n        description: `${object_and_path_mapping[key].createPageActionChainPaths}registerRecordLevelEvents_vbEnter.js`,\n        fileContent:  vb_enter_action_chain_template.replace('{{VB_ENTER_JS}}', objectWiseVbEnter[key])\n    })\n})\n\n\n\n/**\n * Field value change processing\n * Put all action chain is recordLevelEventListener\n */\nif($context.$nodes.RULES_CODE_GENERATOR.$output['fieldValueChange']) {\n    const allFieldValueChangeActions = $context.$nodes.RULES_CODE_GENERATOR.$output['fieldValueChange'];\n\n    const groupByFieldName = allFieldValueChangeActions.reduce((allActions, action) => {\n        const fieldName = `${action.triggers[0].objectName}.${action.triggers[0].fieldName}`\n        allActions[fieldName] = allActions[fieldName] || [];\n        allActions[fieldName].push(`\n            await Actions.callChain(context, {\n                chain: 'flow:${action.id}',\n                params: { recordLevelEvent, uefContext: uefContext }\n                }, { id: '${action.id}' });\n            `);\n            return allActions;\n    }, {});\n\n    /**Generate switch on field name for vb recordLevelEventListener */\n    const fieldValueChangeSwitchOverFields = `\n        switch (recordLevelEvent.data[0].fieldName) {\n            ${Object.keys(groupByFieldName || {}).map((key) => {\n                /**\n                 * For each field aka key there will be a case and all actionChain invoke logic\n                 */\n\n                return \"case '\"+ key + \"': \\n\" +  groupByFieldName[key].join('\\n') + \"break;\"\n            }).join('\\n')}\n            \n            default:\n                break;\n        }\n    `;\n\n    RECORD_LEVEL_LISTENER_ACTION_CHAIN_TEMPLATE = RECORD_LEVEL_LISTENER_ACTION_CHAIN_TEMPLATE.replace('{{FIELD_VALUE_ACTION_CHAIN_CALL}}', fieldValueChangeSwitchOverFields);\n}\n\n/**\n * ToDo\n * For all objects push registerRecordLevel chain at different page level\n * Also need to update json for event listener\n * */\nresult.push({\n    fileContent: RECORD_LEVEL_LISTENER_ACTION_CHAIN_TEMPLATE,\n    description: `${object_and_path_mapping['ServiceRequest'].flowActionChainPaths}recordLevelEventListener_${workspaceId}.js`,\n    fileName: `recordLevelEventListener_${workspaceId}.js`\n});\n\n\nuiControlActionChainTemplate = uiControlActionChainTemplate.replace('{{UI_ACTIONS}}', Object.keys(uiControlObjectIdWiseCases).reduce((js, caseKey) => {\n    return js + `\n    case '${caseKey}': {\n            ${uiControlObjectIdWiseCases[caseKey].join('\\n')}\n        }\n        break;\n    `\n}, \"\"));\n\n\n// UI controlAction chain\n// There will be only one workspace processing\nresult.push({\n  fileName: `UiControlActionChain_${workspaceId}.js`,\n  fileContent: uiControlActionChainTemplate,\n  description: `${object_and_path_mapping.ServiceRequest.flowActionChainPaths}/UiControlActionChain_${workspaceId}.js`,\n});\n\nreturn result;"
                  },
                  "outcomes": {
                    "success": "end_1762530426581"
                  },
